title Mycelium fact batching r4 — the batched Cord reads true (app==awk 2 700 1); the arc closes
prompt Keep going on the next agent-doable crux Lindy-first; send each increment as its own signed round; stop only at custody gates
think r1 (fold identical), r2 (travels), r3 (throughput) landed and sent. The design read names r4 as the closing rung: read a real batched fixture true, cross-checked against an independent reading — two tools, one answer.
think Built the r4 support + reader mirroring the elder Cord r4: mycelium/cord_batch_fixture_gen.rye reproducibly emits the honest two-batch scene to a format cord-batch-v1 record; tools/fixtures/cord_batch_dag.bron holds it; a mycelium/corpora/ symlink @embedFile-binds it; tools/fixtures/cord_batch_truth.awk reads it independently.
think The batched record carries supply arithmetic on its `fact` lines (not `block` lines like the single-fact record), so the truth awk sums fact kinds — kind 1 issues, kind 2/3 drain, kind 3 counts a star — and counts blocks from `block` lines.
think mycelium/cord_batch_true.rye @embedFiles the fixture, parses via r2, rebuilds the Dag under r1's own add_batch (every block and fact signature re-verified), commits, asserts the identity permutation (the recorded order is the true agreed one), folds the real Mycelium law, and reports blocks·supply·stars.
think Learned in-round (already knew from the elder): this toolchain's `print` writes to stderr, so the fixture is generated by capturing stderr (`2> fixture`), matching the elder cord_fixture_gen convention.
obs The crux on metal: the app's measure triple equals awk's reading of the same bytes — both `2 700 1` — so a batched history can never drift from facts a keeper adds up by hand. Genuineness: the record re-renders to the embedded bytes exactly (fixed point), the generator re-emits byte-identical bytes (REPRODUCIBLE), a tampered header refuses BadFormat.
obs Additive — composes cord_batch + cord_batch_bron + fold public API only; r2 and r3 both re-run GREEN at the witness door. Demo keeper seeds only — no key/funds/network/custody.
loom witness=mycelium_cord_batch_true_witness app_awk=2_700_1 blocks=2 supply=700 stars=1 reproducible=yes
